save__Entry_interview.BMRB_deposition
   _Item.Sf_category             item_description
   _Item.Sf_framecode           '_Entry_interview.BMRB_deposition'
   _Item.ID                      7
   _Item.Name                   '_Entry_interview.BMRB_deposition'
   _Item.Description
;
Check this box, if you are depositing NMR experimental data to be archived 
at the BioMagResBank.  With this box checked, after clicking on the 'Save Changes' 
button, you will be asked to enter additional information regarding the data 
submitted. Files containing the data sets should be uploaded by filling out 
the form found by clicking on the 'Deposit data files' link in the frame on the 
left of the screen.
;

   _Item.Category_ID                            1
   _Item.Category_label                        '$Entry_interview'
   _Item.Mandatory_code                         no
   _Item.Type_code                             'yes_no'


save_

save__Entry_interview.View_mode
   _Item.Sf_category             item_description
   _Item.Sf_framecode           '_Entry_interview.View_mode'
   _Item.ID                      8
   _Item.Name                   '_Entry_interview.View_mode'
   _Item.Description
;
The 'view mode' buttons are used to select between a view of the PDB or 
the BMRB deposition requirements. The majority of the information you enter will 
apply to both a PDB and a BMRB deposition. When in the PDB view mode, a deposition 
can be submitted to PDB and when in the BMRB view mode, a deposition can be 
submitted to BMRB.
;

   _Item.Category_ID                            1
   _Item.Category_label                        '$Entry_interview'
   _Item.Mandatory_code                         no
   _Item.Type_code                             'code'
   _Item.Default_value                         '?'
   _Item.Enumerated_code                        yes
   _Item.Enumeration_closed_code                yes

   loop_
     _Item_enumeration.Item_name
     _Item_enumeration.Value
     _Item_enumeration.Detail
     _Item_enumeration.Item_ID
     _Item_enumeration.Category_ID
     _Item_enumeration.Dictionary_ID

  '_Entry_interview.View_mode'   PDB/BMRB    ?      8      1     NMR-STAR
  '_Entry_interview.View_mode'   'BMRB Only'    ?      8      1     NMR-STAR

   stop_


save_

