save_Conformer_stat_list
   _Category.Sf_category                category_description
   _Category.Sf_framecode               Conformer_stat_list
   _Category.ID                         328
   _Category.Name                      'Conformer_stat_list'
   _category.Description
;
Items in the conformer_stat_list category provide information about a list of reported statistics derived from a set of conformers calculated for a molecular assembly.
;
   _Category.Mandatory_code             yes
   _Category.Loop_code                  no
   _Category.Category_group_ID          80
   _Category.Category_group_name        conformer_statistics
   _Category.Dictionary_ID              NMR-STAR

   loop_
     _Category_primary_key.Item_ID
     _Category_primary_key.Item_label
     _Category_primary_key.Item_name
     _Category_primary_key.Category_ID
     _Category_primary_key.Dictionary_ID

    4685   '$_Conformer_stat_list.Entry_ID'     '_Conformer_stat_list.Entry_ID'    328   NMR-STAR
    4687   '$_Conformer_stat_list.ID'     '_Conformer_stat_list.ID'    328   NMR-STAR

   stop_

save_

