save_Atom_site
   _Category.Sf_category                category_description
   _Category.Sf_framecode               Atom_site
   _Category.ID                         341
   _Category.Name                      'Atom_site'
   _category.Description
;
Data items in the atom_site category record details about the atom sites in a macromolecular structure, such as the positional coordinates, atomic displacement parameters, magnetic moments and directions.
;
   _Category.Loop_code                  yes
   _Category.Category_group_ID          83
   _Category.Category_group_name        conformer_family_coord_set
   _Category.Dictionary_ID              NMR-STAR

   loop_
     _Category_primary_key.Item_ID
     _Category_primary_key.Item_label
     _Category_primary_key.Item_name
     _Category_primary_key.Category_ID
     _Category_primary_key.Dictionary_ID

    4875   '$_Atom_site.ID'     '_Atom_site.ID'    341   NMR-STAR
    4918   '$_Atom_site.Entry_ID'     '_Atom_site.Entry_ID'    341   NMR-STAR
    4919   '$_Atom_site.Conformer_family_coord_set_ID'     '_Atom_site.Conformer_family_coord_set_ID'    341   NMR-STAR

   stop_

save_

