   _Category.ID                         350
   _Category.Name                      'Constraint_stat_list_ens'
   _category.Description
;
Items in the constraint_stat_list_ens category record statistical information about the constraints used to calculate the reported ensemble of conformers.
;
   _Category.Loop_code                  yes
   _Category.Category_group_ID          81
   _Category.Category_group_name        constraint_statistics
   _Category.Dictionary_ID              NMR-STAR

   loop_
     _Category_primary_key.Item_ID
     _Category_primary_key.Item_label
     _Category_primary_key.Item_name
     _Category_primary_key.Category_ID
     _Category_primary_key.Dictionary_ID

    5126   '$_Constraint_stat_list_ens.Entry_ID'     '_Constraint_stat_list_ens.Entry_ID'    350   NMR-STAR
    5127   '$_Constraint_stat_list_ens.Constraint_stat_list_ID'     '_Constraint_stat_list_ens.Constraint_stat_list_ID'    350   NMR-STAR

   stop_

save_

save__Constraint_stat_list_ens.Constraint_stats_not_available
   _Item.Sf_category             item_description
   _Item.Sf_framecode           '_Constraint_stat_list_ens.Constraint_stats_not_available'
   _Item.ID                      5089
   _Item.Name                   '_Constraint_stat_list_ens.Constraint_stats_not_available'
   _Item.Description
;
Depositors are strongly encouraged to provide a few statistics related 
to the constraints used to calculate the ensemble of conformers and the conformer 
ensemble. If the statistics are not available, the box provided can be checked 
and the constraint statistics page saved. This will remove the mandatory requirement 
to enter the statistical data.
;

   _Item.Category_ID                            350
   _Item.Category_label                        '$Constraint_stat_list_ens'
   _Item.Mandatory_code                         no
   _Item.Type_code                             'yes_no'
