save_Observed_conformer
   _Category.Sf_category                category_description
   _Category.Sf_framecode               Observed_conformer
   _Category.ID                         374
   _Category.Name                      'Observed_conformer'
   _category.Description
;
Items in the observed_conformer category define the individual conformer(s) where the reported interactions are observed.
;
   _Category.Mandatory_code             yes
   _Category.Loop_code                  yes
