save__Torsion_angle_constraint.Combination_ID
   _Item.Sf_category             item_description
   _Item.Sf_framecode           '_Torsion_angle_constraint.Combination_ID'
   _Item.ID                      5916
   _Item.Name                   '_Torsion_angle_constraint.Combination_ID'
   _Item.Description
;
An identifier for a constraint item combination within a dihedral constraint. 
Constraint items with the same constraint_.Combination_id must be part of 
the same constraint. When calculating a constraint they are AND-ed together, while 
contributions with different constraint.Combination_id (or none) are OR-ed.
;

   _Item.Category_ID                            408
   _Item.Category_label                        '$Torsion_angle_constraint'
   _Item.Mandatory_code                         no
   _Item.Type_code                             'int'


save_

